Add proxy support, online authors, checkbox terms, and a settings modal

Four iterations in one pass:

- Outbound site calls go through undici with an optional ProxyAgent
  built from the new proxyUrl setting (userinfo becomes the Basic
  token); connect/sync/push all inherit it, and a dead proxy fails
  fast with the proxy named in the error.
- Sync now pulls GET /users (edit_posts and up) as the authoritative
  author list, feeding the default-author setting and the per-row
  dropdown; local remarks survive the refresh.
- Term selection in the detail panel is horizontal checkbox chips per
  taxonomy, with a compact "new" input keeping the create-on-push
  ability for names the registry does not have yet.
- Settings moved into a real modal (Esc/backdrop close) with separate
  Save and Test buttons; testing layers the typed values over the
  stored settings without persisting them.

Contract tests cover the proxy setting round-trip and the connect
override semantics; runtime-verified against the live site (authors
pulled, dead proxy 2s fail, cleared proxy reconnects).
